  Calculation type                        : CASSCF
  Number of atoms                         : 3
  Number of basis functions               : 7
  Primitive gaussians                     : 21
  Spin density                            : read from the .fchk
  CAS active electrons                    : 4
  CAS active orbitals                     : 4
  CAS spin-orbitals                       : 14
  Alpha / beta electrons                  : 5 / 5
  SCF energy (au)                         :     -75.0085688627

  Note: closed-shell correlated wavefunction: its local spins come from electron correlation

  -----------------
    INPUT SUMMARY
  -----------------

  # METHOD
  Atomic definition                       : TFVC (topological fuzzy Voronoi cells)
  Energy decomposition                    : ENPART (IQA terms, see # ENPART)
  Local spin                              : SPIN
  Fragments                               : 2 (see # FRAGMENTS)
  Output detail                           : full (VERBOSE 1)

  # ENPART
  Functional                              : CASSCF
  Atom-pair threshold (bond order)        : 0 (THREBOD 0: every atom pair)
  Two-electron grid                       : 40 x 146 (# GRID)
  Rotation angles (two-electron grid)     : 0.162 / 0.182 (calibrated)
  Other options                           : CORRELATION

  # FRAGMENTS (2 fragments)
  Fragment  1 :   1
  Fragment  2 :   2   3

  # DM
  Density matrices                        : 2-RDM
  Source                                  : pySCF
  1-RDM file                              : H2O-CAS44.dm1
  2-RDM file                              : H2O-CAS44.dm2

